  "interpretation": "Source-prefix sweep: reconstruction R\u00b2 as a function of how many layers' sources are available (\u2113\u2264\u2113_max), with the SSM free to propagate them forward. \u2113_max=0 is the pre-registered embedding-only lower bound \u2014 and since v_0 has no SAE (u_0=0 in every available dictionary), it is the example-independent floor: with no source to inject, the input-free state trajectory is the same for every example. The curve's rise with \u2113_max measures how much each band of per-layer sources is load-bearing; if it only saturates near \u2113_max=L-1, late-layer sources (Geva et al.'s built-up features) carry real, non-propagable reconstruction value. Complement of the use_state=False ablation (keeps sources, kills propagation).",
